    <profile name="Axe of Khorne" id="0509-f3b4-84ae-42d4" hidden="false" page="52" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">A hit from the Axe of Khorne causes D3 wounds instead of just 1. In addition, the axe adds +1 to the Strength in close combat</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Bloodthirster&apos;s Whip" id="ba7b-216c-5014-79e8" hidden="false" page="52" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">At the start of close combat, a Bloodthirster can make a special attack with the whip against 1 enemy model in base contact. The model targeted must roll under its Initiative to avoid the whip (a 6 always fails). If it fails to avoid the attack it takes a S8 hit with a -5 save modifier. 
The whip counts as an additional hand weapon giving the Bloodthirster an extra Attack dice</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Collar of Khorne" id="1aec-2c39-21ff-b1cb" hidden="false" page="54" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">Force weapons lose their Strength bonus and do not wound the Flesh Hound automatically. Psyhcic attacks that target the wearer or include it in their area of effect are nullified and will not work.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Hellblade" id="920a-c604-19b7-d162" hidden="false" page="53" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">A hit from a Hellblade adds +1 to the Bloodletters Strength and causes D3 wounds instead of 1.
Allows the Bloodletter to Parry</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Huge Claws" id="42dd-1200-da4c-bb6f" hidden="false" page="55" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">The Daemonette&apos;s claws add +1 to its Strength in close combat.</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Plaguesword" id="6b2f-a25c-767f-d36c" hidden="false" page="58" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">A wound from a Plaguesword will kill mortal creatures on a 4+ regardless of how many wounds they have. Allows the user to parry</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Scorpion Tail" id="2ed4-32b5-5144-9ac8" hidden="false" page="56" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">If the Fiend wins close combat it gains 1 additional hit. This extra hit also has a +1 Strength bonus</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
    <profile name="Stream of Corruption" id="59c7-7d73-2503-11ea" hidden="false" page="57" publicationId="02e1-3f69-7ae7-f5c5" typeId="cc8b-49d5-829c-bfaf" typeName="Wargear">
      <characteristics>
        <characteristic name="Special" typeId="f917-8cd8-7592-47dd">May unleash a stream during the shooting phase, using the Flamer template. Causes a S7 hit with a -2 save modifier and inflicts 1 Wound. May be used in close combat</characteristic>
      </characteristics>
    </profile>
